const journalTools=document.createElement('div');journalTools.className='studio-box journal-tools';journalTools.innerHTML=`<h3 id="journal-copy-7">Find a moment</h3><label for="journal-search">Words or a date</label><input type="search" id="journal-search" maxlength="100" placeholder="A name, a memory, 2026-10…"><div class="growth-fields"><div><label for="journal-from">From</label><input type="date" id="journal-from"></div><div><label for="journal-to">Through</label><input type="date" id="journal-to"></div></div><label><input type="checkbox" id="journal-trash"> Show recovery bin</label><p class="studio-note" id="journal-copy-8">Deleted entries can be restored until you permanently remove them. Entries deleted before this update may no longer contain recoverable content. Locking the journal also locks its recovery bin.</p><div class="studio-row"><button class="outline-button" id="journal-csv">Export matching entries · CSV</button><button class="outline-button" id="journal-print">Print / save as PDF</button></div><p class="studio-note" id="journal-copy-9">Exports contain readable text. Save them somewhere private. Photos and audio stay in full backups.</p><p id="journal-export-language-note" class="studio-note">CSV and printed copies contain readable journal words. Period labels use your chosen language; dates and your entries stay as written.</p><p id="journal-search-status" role="status"></p><button class="text-button" id="journal-more">Show more moments</button>`;
